### **2. Move git.java into Maven folder structure**

Create this folder structure and move `git.java`:
```
Jenkins/
├── pom.xml (NEW - create this)
├── git.java (OLD - you can delete this after moving it)
└── src/
    └── main/
        └── java/
            └── git.java (MOVED here)
```

## **Your Final Folder Structure:**
```
Jenkins/
├── pom.xml
└── src/
    └── main/
        └── java/
            └── git.java